    ],
    "skyPreset": "golden_alpine_meadow",
    "loreSummary": "The one lobe anyone has WALKED that carries all three of the things Reedstrand lives on at once \u2014 c06/r05 carries the same three and nobody has set foot on it: open meadow to sow, six mires to cut, and standing wet wood. The swamp forest and the carr here are the only carr drawn off Wealdmarch \u2014 four of the world's five stand in the basin and the fifth is this one \u2014 so the timber worked here is the only carr-wood on the delta that has been reached."
  },
